libxisf0 for Debian

LibXISF original sources include some bundled libraries (lz4, pugixml and
zlib). Instead of using those libs, this package is built against the same
libraries but from standard debian packages. As a result, bundled libs
are excluded from source package.

 -- Matteo Piscitelli <matteo@matteopiscitelli.it>  Wed, 23 Jul 2025 16:20:52 +0200
